From cfb0b0d032cc4b843b3e8f9f70ff971c8076c23d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitri <dms202575p@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 12:52:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fullscreen touch mapping, finger-tap cursor sync, GDI default
 for new containers

- TouchpadView: in Fullscreen the X screen is stretched over the whole view,
  so map X/Y with separate scales; recompute the mapping when Fullscreen is
  toggled from the drawer (no size change happens then). Fixes the pen/finger
  position not matching the cursor in Fullscreen.
- New setting (default on): move the cursor to the finger before a tap click.
- New containers default to WineD3D with renderer=gdi (existing containers
  keep their settings).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018cLUKUNDhFWb9gSFtJ7vW4
